{% extends "_base.html.j2" %}
{% from "_macros.html.j2" import fn with context %}
{% block title %}This autumn — Czech Hockey Atlas{% endblock %}
{% block description %}Two dated, sourced items of Czech hockey news, beside the atlas's own numbers.{% endblock %}
{% block canonical %}https://hockey.bsandova.com/this-autumn/{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<main id="content">
{% if autumn %}
{% set au = autumn %}
{% set cp = au.captain %}
{% set co = au.coach %}
<section class="slide autumn" id="autumn">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="close-kicker">News</p>
    <h1 class="slide-q">This autumn</h1>
    <p class="autumn-asof">Atlas data as of {{ au.data_as_of }}; news as of {{ au.news_as_of }}</p>
    <div class="autumn-body">
      <p class="autumn-lede">Two dated items of news, with their sources listed at the end of this section. The numbers beside them are the atlas's own, from its snapshot, which this section does not refresh.</p>

      <h3 id="autumn-coach">A new head coach of the national team</h3>
      <p>{{ co.new }} succeeds {{ co.previous }} as head coach of the Czech men's national team. {{ co.approved_by[0]|upper }}{{ co.approved_by[1:] }} approved the appointment on {{ co.approved }}, with {{ co.contract_years }}-year contracts.{{ fn(co.notes_approved) }} The staff: {{ co.new }} with coaches {{ co.coaches|join(' and ') }}, goalkeeping coach {{ co.goalkeeping_coach }}, and {{ co.general_manager }} as general manager in place of {{ co.previous_general_manager }}.{{ fn(co.notes_staff) }} The first game under the new staff is on {{ co.first_game.date }} against {{ co.first_game.opponent }} at the {{ co.first_game.venue }} ({{ co.first_game.competition }}).{{ fn(co.first_game.notes) }}</p>
      <p class="capita-note">What the national team's rosters have been built from since {{ q6.first_year }}, by league: <a href="../{{ qurl.q6 }}">question 6</a>.</p>

      <h3 id="autumn-captain">A club captaincy in the NHL</h3>
      <p>On {{ cp.named }} the {{ cp.club }} named {{ cp.name }} the {{ cp.nth }} captain in the club's history.{{ fn(cp.notes_named) }} The previous captain was {{ cp.previous }} ({{ cp.previous_note }}).{{ fn(cp.notes_previous) }} According to hokej.cz, {{ cp.name.split(' ')[-1] }} is the {{ cp.czech_nth }} Czech to be a permanent captain in the NHL.{{ fn(cp.notes_czech_nth) }} The captaincy is with his NHL club, not a national-team role.</p>
      {% set s = cp.season %}
      {% set a = cp.abroad %}
      <dl class="autumn-stats" aria-label="{{ cp.name }}, {{ s.league }} {{ s.season }}, from the atlas">
        <div><dt>{{ s.league }} games, {{ s.season }}</dt><dd>{{ num(s.games) }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Points</dt><dd>{{ num(s.points) }} <span class="muted">{{ num(s.goals) }} goals, {{ num(s.assists) }} assists</span></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Ice time per game</dt><dd>{{ mmss(s.toi_per_game_s) }}{% if a %} <span class="muted">median {{ mmss(a.median_toi_per_game_s) }}</span>{% endif %}</dd></div>
        {% if a %}
        <div><dt>Points per game</dt><dd>{{ f2(a.points_per_game) }} <span class="muted">median {{ f2(a.median_points_per_game) }}</span></dd></div>
        {% endif %}
      </dl>
      <p class="capita-note">From the atlas's pool data, {{ s.league }} {{ s.season }}. The median is over all {{ s.league }} {{ cp.position_word }} who reached the games threshold that season, as in <a href="../{{ qurl.q5 }}">question 5</a>. His seasons since {{ pool.window.split('–')[0] }} are on the <a href="../players/">pool page</a>.</p>

      <h3 class="autumn-sources-h">Sources</h3>
      <ol class="autumn-sources">
        {% for src in au.sources %}
        <li id="autumn-src-{{ src.n }}">{{ src.publisher }} ({{ src.date or 'n.d.' }}). <a href="{{ src.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ src.url }}</a>, accessed {{ src.accessed }}.</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
</main>
{% endblock %}
